    "description": "``?`` is a character, used in various situations.\n\n+ Ternary operator: ``$a ? $b : $c``\n+ Short ternary operator: ``$a ?: $c``\n+ Coalesce operator: ``$a ??``\n+ Null type, ``function foo(?int $int) {}``\n+ As a quantifier in regex, 0 or 1\n+ As a quantifier with ``fnmatch()``, 0 or 1.",
